<title>USA: Orbit says suit without merit.</title>
<headline>Orbit says suit without merit.</headline>
<dateline>CARLSBAD, Calif 1997-06-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Orbit Technologies Inc said Tuesday that a recent suit filed by two investors seeking to unseat the company's board is considered by management to be without merit.</p>
<p>The company will vigorously defend the rights of all bonafide Orbit shareholders in this action.</p>
<p>Earlier this month, Richard and Edgar Benveniste fied suit in Delaware Chancery Court. According to court papers, the brothers allege the director defendants were &quot;duly and validly removed as directors and officers&quot; and replaced.</p>
</text>
